<title>THAILAND: Thai money, forex markets closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Thai money, forex markets closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's money and foreign exchange markets were closed on Monday for a holiday marking the beginning of Buddhist Lent.</p>
<p>The baht was quoted at 30.42/30.47 per dollar late onshore and 30.35/30.45 in offshore markets late on Friday.</p>
<p>The interbank rate eased to 14-15 percent late on Friday.</p>
<p>Markets will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
